```
iifname "eth2" ip saddr 172.16.10.0/24 ip daddr 172.18.51.1 tcp dport 80 → ACCEPT (1 narrow exception)
iifname "eth2" meta l4proto tcp  → DROP
iifname "eth2" meta l4proto udp  → DROP
iifname "eth2"                   → DROP  ← 28 pkts/2352 bytes actively dropped
